City Car Driving – is an innovative, intriguing, and at times quite versatile car simulator. If you thought this was a typical game project that wouldn't deliver the desired impact and excitement, you're sorely mistaken, as the game's main feature is that it was created by Russian developers, who added a ton of interesting and familiar cars, and didn't forget to touch on foreign automakers. However, in most cases, you'll only notice Russian cars.

So, in this game, you'll become a simple car enthusiast with access to a wide variety of cars and complete freedom to explore two huge cities. The game offers the opportunity to get your driver's license, cruise through busy streets, and enjoy nighttime driving on highways. However, don't get too carried away, as the game assumes the player will obey traffic rules. If not, the traffic police are still around, and this is an unpleasant detail to consider in any case. But if you want to start driving and enjoying the ride right now, simply download the game. City Car Driving Download it for free via torrent and begin your adventure. We wish you a pleasant ride and recommend exploring the other features of this exciting game.

Game features:
- Designed specifically for a broad global audience, this game project features a variety of languages that represent the entire game interface. Naturally, Russian is the foundation of this game and allows for a fully immersive experience.
- When we noted that a wide range of cars would be available to the player, we did not indicate that in this scenario, both left-hand and right-hand drive options would be available to enhance the driving experience of individual foreign cars;
- The updated version of the game project offers its users the opportunity to drive not only according to Russian traffic regulations, but also to try out their skills in American traffic regulations. Be careful and learn all the nuances;
- It's essential to consider realistic weather conditions, which allow you to experience the full complexity of driving a car in winter or rainy weather. To avoid an accident, you'll have to put in maximum effort and demonstrate all your skills;
- an interesting feature is the presence of a rather original model for creating unpredictable situations, among which it is worth noting a pedestrian crossing the road, an unexpected car flying out, traffic jams and other unpleasant moments. Now all of this can be studied and the right decisions can be made while driving, sometimes using extreme driving skills;
- And if you think that simply riding around the cities will be boring for you, then don’t be upset, because this will not happen, because you just need to turn on a special route-building simulation and the built-in program will assign you an individual route each time, which you can complete and receive recognition and simple pleasure for it. Routes will be built quite often and will not let you get bored;
- You will have access to two huge megacities, allowing you not only to relax, but also to get an impression of the detail and originality of the infrastructure construction. Yes, they may not be so ideal, but all the road routes are followed to the maximum extent;
- 11 different player cars are available, allowing you to experience all the joys of driving a wide variety of vehicles. For example, you can take a ride in a simple Lada, switch to a PAZ, or take control of a foreign car; no one will limit your choice;
- And if you thought that the game had no goal, then don't be mistaken, as you will have access to 24 tasks of varying difficulty levels and directions, they will allow you to experience all the delights of your adventure, teach you how to drive correctly in various situations and simply test your knowledge of traffic rules;
- regarding simulation, this category mainly includes the car's gearbox, which can be manual or automatic; depending on the type, your driving pattern will be felt in one way or another; also, don't forget about the technical characteristics of the cars and the road surface;
- It's impossible not to mention the graphic settings, which are cranked up to almost the maximum in this game. You just need to set the ultra values and your monitor will sparkle with a high-quality and pleasant picture;
- As for the sound, it is of the highest quality and recorded from real prototype engines, the environment in the game is also directly inspired by real life, so you are guaranteed immersion in the atmosphere;
- thanks to high-quality graphics technology, you can easily view a high-quality damage model that will reflect your driving quality and show you exactly where you went wrong;
- and for the most ardent fans of this kind of gaming adventure, we offer a torrent download City Car Driving We've also adopted the Oculus Rift, and yes, it supports virtual reality, which means it's time to open the doors to a new virtual world!

